Sokha's family has many celebrations this year. His parents' twentieth wedding anniversary is in March. His cousin's engagement party is in April. In June, there's a baby shower for his aunt and a graduation ceremony for his sister. His grandfather will have a retirement party, and a neighbour will host a housewarming. Mum is writing the guest list!

